  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-errors\r\nU\\+000D CARRIAGE RETURN is an [ASCII whitespace character](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace), no need to mention it separately.\r\nReplace this:\r\n> This error occurs if the parser encounters a numeric character reference that references a control code point that is not ASCII whitespace, a U\\+000D CARRIAGE RETURN, or U\\+0000 NULL\\.\r\n\r\nWith this:\r\n> This error occurs if the parser encounters a numeric character reference that references a control code point that is not ASCII whitespace or U\\+0000 NULL\\.\r\n",
